            "**位元拆分 (Bit-by-bit)**：\n- 將每個數拆成 30 或 62 個位元，獨立計算每一位的貢獻\n- 常用於解決 XOR/AND/OR 相關的加總問題\n\n:::example 逐位計算每個 bit 的貢獻\n**C++ 模板**：\n\n```cpp\n// 逐位計算每個 bit 的貢獻\nfor (int i = 0; i < 30; ++i) {\n    int count1 = 0;\n    for (int x : nums) {\n        if ((x >> i) & 1) {\n            ++count1;\n        }\n    }\n    // 根據 count1 (1的個數) 和 n - count1 (0的個數) 計算貢獻\n    long long combinations = (long long)count1 * (n - count1);\n    ans += combinations * (1LL << i);\n}\n```\n:::\n\n**搭配練習**\n\n| ID | Problem | Rating |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 477 | [漢明距離總和](https://leetcode.cn/problems/total-hamming-distance) |  |\n| 1835 | [所有數對按位與結果的異或和](https://leetcode.cn/problems/find-xor-sum-of-all-pairs-bitwise-and) | 1825 |\n| 1863 | [找出所有子集的異或總和再求和](https://leetcode.cn/problems/sum-of-all-subset-xor-totals) | 1372 |\n| 2275 | [按位與結果大於零的最長組合](https://leetcode.cn/problems/largest-combination-with-bitwise-and-greater-than-zero) | 1642 |\n| 2425 | [所有數對的異或和](https://leetcode.cn/problems/bitwise-xor-of-all-pairings) | 1622 |\n| 2505 | [所有子序列和的按位或](https://leetcode.cn/problems/bitwise-or-of-all-subsequence-sums) |  |\n| 3688 | [偶數的按位或運算](https://leetcode.cn/problems/bitwise-or-of-even-numbers-in-an-array) | 1205 |",
